WEBVTT

00:10:26.688 --> 00:10:30.867
wanneer het aan de vluchteling
niet zegt: "Ga weg,"

00:10:30.867 --> 00:10:34.608
maar: "Het is OK. 
We hebben je. Je bent veilig nu."

00:10:35.112 --> 00:10:36.275
Dank je.

00:10:36.299 --> 00:10:39.124
(Applaus)

00:10:39.148 --> 00:10:40.354
Bedankt.

00:10:40.378 --> 00:10:41.739
(Applaus)